WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:06.506 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(cris et applaudissements)

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:20.053 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Trois chefs, trois campagnes,

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:21.288 size:53% position:73% line:53%
