00:00:25.926 --> 00:00:29.629 size:53% position:73% line:53%
EMMANUELLE RICHEZ, politologue,

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:30.997 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Université de Windsor, Ontario

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:32.365 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ce que les études révèlent,

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:33.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est que le candidat local a un

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:35.101 size:53% position:73% line:53%
