00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:41.875 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui importe.

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:43.210 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On voit des courses entre

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:44.578 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le Parti libéral et le Parti

00:00:42.209 --> 00:00:45.946 size:53% position:73% line:53%
