00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:28.088 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Hamilton-Est-Stoney Creek.

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:48.141 size:53% position:73% line:53%
L'avocat né de parents

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:49.509 size:53% position:73% line:53%
