00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:40.487 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La question du logement

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:41.821 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et de la difficulté, voyons,

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:43.723 size:53% position:73% line:53%
