00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:50.296 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:51.664 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Dans ce quartier d'Hamilton,

00:03:49.262 --> 00:03:53.032 size:53% position:73% line:53%
260 nouvelles unités

00:03:50.629 --> 00:03:54.367 size:53% position:73% line:53%
