00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:24.197 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Dans cette région de l'Ontario

00:04:21.794 --> 00:04:25.565 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à la fois industrielle, urbaine

00:04:23.163 --> 00:04:28.334 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et rurale, la campagne est

00:04:24.531 --> 00:04:29.669 size:53% position:73% line:53%
serrée et le résultat,

00:04:25.899 --> 00:04:31.037 size:53% position:73% line:53%
difficile à prévoir.

00:04:28.668 --> 00:04:32.405 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Oui, il faut jamais

00:04:30.003 --> 00:04:33.773 size:53% position:73% line:53%
