00:04:36.809 --> 00:04:42.715 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une différence.

00:04:40.346 --> 00:04:44.084 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Une chose sera le taux de vote

00:04:41.681 --> 00:04:45.418 size:53% position:73% line:53%
